+- Click's error messages and deprecation warnings name a parameter by its `spec`.
+  A deprecated option reports `The option '--my-option' is deprecated.` instead
+  of `'my_option'`.
+- {attr}`Parameter.human_readable_name` is deprecated and returns `spec`. For an
